# Shell scripts MUST stay LF in the working tree, on every platform. On a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf set, git otherwise rewrites them to CRLF,
# and the container's /bin/sh then rejects deploy/compose-init.sh at boot
# ("set: Illegal option -"), breaking `docker compose up`. Scoped narrowly
# (no repo-wide `* text=auto`) to avoid renormalizing the whole tree.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never apply end-of-line conversion or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.vsix binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
